  "details": "[Summary]\n\nIn the recent Open Beta version, the \"Download Print\" feature for pictures completely stopped working on the PC version (both PCVR and Desktop modes). Switching back to the Live version resolved the issue.\n\n[Steps to Reproduce]\n\nJoin VRChat using the Open Beta build on PC.\n\nTry to download a picture as a \"Print\".\n\nClick the download button.\n\n[Expected Result]\n\nThe print image should be downloaded and saved to the local PC storage.\n\n[Actual Result]\n\nNothing happens. The system is completely unresponsive, and no error messages appear.\n\n[Additional Information]\n\nRegular screenshots (taken via the in-game camera) are saved normally to the PC.\n\nThe issue persists even after logging in with a different account on the same PC.\n\nThe mobile version (Smartphone) works perfectly, and prints can be downloaded to the device without any issues.\n\nReturning to the current Live (Public) version completely fixes this problem, so this seems to be a bug specific to the Open Beta build.",
